                        <svg class="icono" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 3h-4.2a3 3 0 0 0-5.6 0H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2Zm-7 0a1 1 0 1 1-1 1 1 1 0 0 1 1-1Zm-2 14-4-4 1.4-1.4L10 14.2l6.6-6.6L18 9l-8 8Z" /></svg> Mis tareas
                    </NavLink>
                </div>
                <div class="nav-item px-3">
